<title>USA: SIOUX CITY HOGS STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX CITY HOGS STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.50 higher. Trade moderately active. Top $56.00 per</p>
<p>cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     55.50-56.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     55.00-55.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     52.50-54.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     49.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows:  all weights steady to 0.50 higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     46.00</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     47.50-48.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     49.50</p>
</text>
